So to summarize,

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:57.130
developing your skills
in PowerPoint and Excel

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.370
from my experience is a skills

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:01.530
that is relevant in pretty much

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:03.190
every industry you work on

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:06.280
and pretty much every
function you work on.

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:07.450
And I believe that there are only

